        particular purpose, accuracy, or non-infringement. We do not warrant that results will be
        correct, that the Service will be uninterrupted, or that it is free of errors.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, CircuitSimulate and its contributors will not be
        liable for any indirect, incidental, special or consequential damages, or for any loss of
